WEBVTT

00:02.521 --> 00:06.001
<i>The dress doesn't hide my binder!</i>

00:06.001 --> 00:08.251
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-What do I do now?!</i>

00:09.411 --> 00:12.391
<i>There's no way I can take it off.</i>

00:12.391 --> 00:14.221
<i>But I can't keep it on either...</i>

00:14.221 --> 00:15.631
Ashiya-kun.

00:16.211 --> 00:18.451
Is the length okay?

00:18.451 --> 00:19.831
Y-Yeah!

00:19.831 --> 00:21.301
Looks like it's just right.

00:21.301 --> 00:22.691
Okay.

00:22.691 --> 00:25.141
So Ashiya-kun's dress is good.

00:25.501 --> 00:28.901
<i>I'll have to give up the binder...</i>

00:31.391 --> 00:32.781
You're finally—

00:33.121 --> 00:35.531
Hey, looking cute!

00:36.581 --> 00:37.541
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:37.541 --> 00:39.781
<i>Please let me survive this!</i>

00:40.871 --> 00:43.311
You really look like a girl.

00:43.311 --> 00:44.291
I think it'll do.

00:45.621 --> 00:48.871
These padded bras are really 
nice though, huh?

00:48.871 --> 00:49.791
Yeah, they are.

00:51.471 --> 00:53.171
Hey. Your shoes.

00:53.171 --> 00:55.221
Thanks, Sano.

00:55.221 --> 00:56.341
You in charge of shoes?

00:56.341 --> 00:58.181
They told me to help if I had the time.

00:59.081 --> 01:01.931
Anyway, that dress...

01:04.011 --> 01:05.311
It looks good on you.

01:08.031 --> 01:09.941
<i>He complimented me.</i>

01:10.691 --> 01:12.511
<i>My ears are burning.</i>

01:12.511 --> 01:14.251
<i>I'm so simple.</i>

01:14.251 --> 01:15.381
Mizuki-kun.

01:16.201 --> 01:18.951
These are your stockings
 for the actual dance.

01:18.951 --> 01:19.981
Here you go.

01:20.781 --> 01:23.241
Has something good happened, Kanna-chan?

01:23.241 --> 01:23.921
What?

01:24.891 --> 01:26.211
Can you tell?

01:26.691 --> 01:28.821
Well, what is it?

01:29.301 --> 01:31.461
Um, you see...

01:32.261 --> 01:36.471
Yesterday, Megumi-sama asked me 
to be his dance partner.

01:36.471 --> 01:38.471
Good for you, Kanna-chan!

01:38.471 --> 01:40.321
<i>Nice going, gorilla boy!</i>

01:41.931 --> 01:44.851
Now, how should I put this?

01:45.401 --> 01:48.601
I think you've got a real shot
 at being crowned queen.

01:49.601 --> 01:51.611
Schöne Fräulein!

01:51.611 --> 01:53.261
Would you care to da—

01:52.601 --> 01:53.921
Get lost.

01:54.801 --> 01:55.861
Warum?!

01:58.371 --> 02:01.211
Beautiful raven-haired miss,

02:01.211 --> 02:02.221
would you care to...

02:02.221 --> 02:03.991
Get your hands off of her!

02:03.991 --> 02:06.871
Kanna is my fiancé!

02:09.731 --> 02:10.881
What in the world?!

03:42.011 --> 03:44.511
I'm So Happy!

03:43.661 --> 03:48.561
So then, he goes and spills
 the beans in front of everyone.

03:48.561 --> 03:51.531
Tennoji was real uncomfortable after that.

03:53.291 --> 03:57.141
I'm surprised she'd go
 for a meathead like him.

03:57.141 --> 03:58.021
Right?

03:59.711 --> 04:02.361
So, tomorrow's the big day, huh?

04:03.061 --> 04:04.141
Sure is.

04:05.431 --> 04:09.671
H-Hey, uh, I was wondering if 
I could ask you a favor.

04:11.581 --> 04:14.781
I was hoping you'd dance with me...

04:15.871 --> 04:16.661
Right now.

04:18.101 --> 04:19.361
<i>I really asked him!</i>

04:20.271 --> 04:21.421
Sure.

04:31.641 --> 04:33.231
And a one and a two...

04:45.241 --> 04:46.411
Th-Thanks!

04:46.411 --> 04:47.491
I appreciate it!

04:47.491 --> 04:49.161
I'm going to bed!

04:49.621 --> 04:50.811
Good night!

04:54.901 --> 04:56.491
<i>I wasn't expecting that.</i>

04:57.861 --> 05:00.631
Ladies and gentlemen.

05:00.981 --> 05:05.131
Welcome to the time-honored 
gathering of our two schools.

05:05.511 --> 05:08.761
We hope you will enjoy 
yourselves to the fullest.

05:08.761 --> 05:11.371
Why is she the only one 
who gets a special dress?

05:11.371 --> 05:12.551
Talk about shady.

05:21.951 --> 05:22.651
Hey.

05:23.901 --> 05:26.531
<i>Sano looks so freaking cool!</i>

05:26.531 --> 05:28.781
Mizuki's very, very cute!

05:26.531 --> 05:28.781
SLAM

05:30.161 --> 05:31.351
But seriously...

05:31.351 --> 05:32.971
It looks really good on you.

05:32.971 --> 05:34.801
The boobs are so real too.

05:35.511 --> 05:37.291
<i>That's because they are.</i>

05:38.511 --> 05:40.561
You look pretty sharp yourself.

05:51.491 --> 05:53.431
<i>Oh, wow!</i>

05:53.821 --> 05:55.681
<i>It's like a real ball!</i>

05:55.681 --> 05:59.591
Senpai, I think we're in the wrong place.

05:59.591 --> 06:01.251
I think so too.

06:01.251 --> 06:02.691
Please dance with me.

06:02.691 --> 06:04.091
With me!

06:04.091 --> 06:06.741
Oh, what should I do?

06:06.741 --> 06:10.451
Looks like <i>someone</i> feels 
completely at home here.

06:11.061 --> 06:12.351
There's Nanba-senpai!

06:12.351 --> 06:14.581
He's as popular as ever.

06:14.921 --> 06:18.601
Ten thousand points says
 that that won't last long.

06:18.601 --> 06:19.961
What do you mean?

06:20.671 --> 06:21.961
Here it comes!

06:22.321 --> 06:23.961
Senpai!

06:25.701 --> 06:27.211
Told you.

06:28.151 --> 06:30.721
<i>I wonder where Sano got off to.</i>

06:30.721 --> 06:33.101
Hello, little lambs.

06:36.791 --> 06:38.231
Schöner Abend.

06:40.881 --> 06:44.581
Keep making those innocent little faces,

06:44.581 --> 06:47.231
and the Big Bad Wolf
 will eat you right up.

06:49.161 --> 06:51.971
When you say it,
 it doesn't sound like a joke.

06:51.971 --> 06:53.491
You scared me!

06:53.491 --> 06:55.201
Kujo-senpai!

06:55.201 --> 06:59.251
Kadoma is my partner, so please 
refrain from overstepping.

07:00.151 --> 07:02.881
We're here, so want to try 
a dance before the main event?

07:04.501 --> 07:06.211
O-Osu!

07:07.031 --> 07:10.111
<i>You can't whip out the karate
 stuff dressed like that.</i>

07:11.011 --> 07:14.231
Omigosh, it's Oscar-sama!

07:14.231 --> 07:16.031
Schöne Fräulein.

07:17.111 --> 07:19.021
Hey, there you are!

07:19.021 --> 07:21.581
Mizuki-kun, I've been looking for you.

07:21.581 --> 07:22.901
Rio-chan.

07:22.901 --> 07:24.091
Where have you been?

07:24.091 --> 07:25.901
You weren't in the changing room.

07:25.901 --> 07:27.781
Sorry! I was in the toilet...

07:27.781 --> 07:29.651
<i>It's the only place I can change.</i>

07:29.651 --> 07:31.741
Kanna-chan gave this to me.

07:31.741 --> 07:32.901
What?

07:32.901 --> 07:35.581
Everyone's already wearing theirs,

07:35.581 --> 07:37.571
but you weren't around, so...

07:37.571 --> 07:38.161
Here.

07:38.421 --> 07:39.601
All done!

07:41.161 --> 07:43.791
That looks so good on you, Mizuki-kun!

07:43.791 --> 07:46.061
You really look like a real girl!

07:46.061 --> 07:47.171
Yeah?

07:50.191 --> 07:51.301
I'm sorry.

07:51.301 --> 07:52.821
Huh? Why?

07:52.821 --> 07:55.501
That I got paired up with Sano.

07:58.341 --> 07:59.981
Sorry, but I noticed.

07:59.981 --> 08:02.681
My big brother's who he is, you know?

08:03.081 --> 08:06.411
It's hard when the person you 
have a crush on is too cool, huh?

08:06.411 --> 08:08.021
Leaves you on pins and needles.

08:08.021 --> 08:08.871
Huh?

08:08.871 --> 08:11.191
I saw Sano-kun earlier.

08:11.191 --> 08:13.691
The girls were swarming him,

08:13.691 --> 08:15.131
so he had to keep running away.

08:15.131 --> 08:16.951
<i>Why am I not surprised?</i>

08:16.951 --> 08:19.451
I feel for you, Mizuki-kun.

08:20.071 --> 08:24.081
But I understand these
 kinds of things, so don't worry.

08:24.081 --> 08:24.961
Um...

08:24.961 --> 08:26.031
Good luck!

08:26.031 --> 08:27.301
I'm rooting for you!

08:27.301 --> 08:28.881
See you later!

08:28.881 --> 08:31.211
<i>Rio-chan, you're...</i>

08:34.641 --> 08:37.441
<i>So the girls are flocking to him, huh?</i>

08:37.971 --> 08:39.421
Hey, Mizuki.

08:39.421 --> 08:41.221
Here you are.

08:41.941 --> 08:43.861
What's up? Yer lookin' blue.

08:43.861 --> 08:44.981
Nakatsu?

08:46.571 --> 08:48.731
Would you dance with me, princess?

08:51.751 --> 08:52.481
Okay!

08:59.691 --> 09:01.491
<i>S-Still...</i>

09:02.021 --> 09:04.501
<i>I know I shouldn't, but I keep staring!</i>

09:04.831 --> 09:07.781
<i>Not my fault when they look so real!</i>

09:09.201 --> 09:10.251
Nakatsu.

09:10.551 --> 09:11.331
Yes?!

09:11.331 --> 09:12.311
Check it out.

09:12.311 --> 09:13.881
Looks like Hibari-sama is dancing.

09:14.261 --> 09:18.431
Oh, that girl with the big 
boobs is going to dance too?

09:18.431 --> 09:19.141
<i>Oh no!</i>

09:19.591 --> 09:23.031
<i>Now that I've noticed them,
 I can't stop thinking about them!</i>

09:23.031 --> 09:25.391
<i>Forget aboob it...</i>

09:25.391 --> 09:27.771
<i>Boobs!</i>

09:28.501 --> 09:29.401
Nakatsu?!

09:30.321 --> 09:32.041
Senpai, what's wrong?

09:32.041 --> 09:36.511
Seeing how sexy Hibari-sama is 
made him pass out or something.

09:36.511 --> 09:37.901
<i>Th-That's not it!</i>

09:41.411 --> 09:43.441
Is he going to be okay?

09:48.631 --> 09:49.671
Mizuki-kun!

09:50.001 --> 09:50.971
Oh no!

09:50.971 --> 09:53.421
That's so awful! 
Who would do such a thing?!

09:53.421 --> 09:54.321
That's low.

09:54.321 --> 09:55.921
Oh no. Poor thing...

09:55.921 --> 09:57.871
<i>Guess they got me.</i>

09:57.871 --> 09:59.051
Ashiya.

09:59.461 --> 10:00.361
Sano...

10:00.361 --> 10:02.341
This is terrible.

10:02.341 --> 10:03.571
What happened?

10:03.571 --> 10:04.441
It's terrible.

10:04.441 --> 10:06.311
Someone ruined Mizuki-kun's dress.

10:06.311 --> 10:07.891
It's fine, it's fine!

10:07.891 --> 10:10.471
Rio-chan, I think I can wash it out.

10:10.471 --> 10:12.091
I'll go give it a try.

10:12.091 --> 10:12.811
Hey.

10:13.131 --> 10:16.571
<i>I don't want Sano to see me like this.</i>

10:23.161 --> 10:24.331
<i>It's not coming out...</i>

10:26.311 --> 10:27.451
<i>I won't cry, though.</i>

10:27.451 --> 10:28.561
<i>Not over this.</i>

10:28.561 --> 10:29.961
How's it looking?

10:29.961 --> 10:32.041
No luck, I'm afraid.

10:32.041 --> 10:33.211
It is what it is.

10:33.211 --> 10:34.561
Oh gosh.

10:34.561 --> 10:36.051
Wow, you're right.

10:36.051 --> 10:37.711
It's really stained now.

10:40.231 --> 10:43.101
Mizuki-kun, will you let us
 take care of this?

10:43.101 --> 10:43.811
Huh?

10:45.181 --> 10:46.011
S-Sure...

10:48.411 --> 10:50.561
And now, the highlight of the night:

10:50.931 --> 10:55.571
the dance where our king, queen, 
and best couple will be chosen.

10:57.371 --> 10:59.321
<i>Yup, when it comes to crossdressing,</i>

10:59.321 --> 11:01.091
<i>taking pictures is better than doing it!</i>

11:02.621 --> 11:04.361
I know didn't get a partner,

11:04.361 --> 11:06.661
but why do I have to dance with Nakao?

11:06.971 --> 11:10.661
I won't dance with any guy
 other than Senpai!

11:10.661 --> 11:13.211
Hey, I'm a guy too.

11:16.211 --> 11:20.871
<i>They fixed my dress for me, 
but Nakatsu's gone too.</i>

11:20.871 --> 11:23.691
Ladies and gentlemen, 
it's finally the last dance!

11:25.341 --> 11:28.021
<i>I'm still here at the Christmas ball.</i>

11:28.021 --> 11:30.231
<i>Might as well make the best of it
 and enjoy things.</i>

11:36.891 --> 11:37.971
<i>Ashiya...</i>

11:38.981 --> 11:41.771
If you're that worried
 about him, go to him.

11:42.421 --> 11:44.331
I'll be fine.

11:44.331 --> 11:46.991
Plus, if you don't, 
someone else might take him.

11:46.991 --> 11:48.031
Sorry about this.

11:53.001 --> 11:54.071
Sano?

11:57.381 --> 11:59.001
Huh? Sano?

12:03.901 --> 12:05.221
I'll dance with you.

12:05.801 --> 12:08.011
Being a wallflower's no fun.

12:08.781 --> 12:09.671
But...

12:10.391 --> 12:11.691
It's okay! It's okay!

12:11.691 --> 12:13.601
Go, go, go!

12:14.531 --> 12:16.301
So, what do you say?

12:16.301 --> 12:18.191
Or are you done with dancing?

12:21.051 --> 12:23.401
I'd like to dance.

12:25.781 --> 12:26.661
Me too.

12:29.851 --> 12:30.781
Here we go.

12:31.861 --> 12:33.151
Don't look away.

12:33.151 --> 12:34.611
B-But...

12:34.611 --> 12:35.731
But what?

12:35.731 --> 12:38.541
It's embarrassing.

12:39.371 --> 12:40.301
Dummy.

12:40.301 --> 12:42.051
Relax.

12:42.701 --> 12:44.321
It's just a dance.

12:44.321 --> 12:45.431
Let's keep it easy.

12:52.311 --> 12:53.661
Look.

12:53.661 --> 12:55.181
How cute.

12:55.181 --> 12:57.481
To me, you're a hundred times cuter!

12:57.481 --> 12:59.561
Senpai, Senpai! Check it out!

12:59.561 --> 13:01.041
They look so good!

13:01.041 --> 13:03.301
You're going to get hurt
if you let your eyes wander.

13:18.801 --> 13:20.961
Look at the hummingbird go.

13:21.311 --> 13:24.981
We can't lose to them, Masao-san.

13:24.981 --> 13:26.661
I feel the same.

13:26.661 --> 13:28.461
<i>I'll just have endure this one dance.</i>

13:28.461 --> 13:31.641
<i>Just in order to showcase my 
abilities to their fullest.</i>

13:31.641 --> 13:33.471
<i>Hang in there, hang in there.</i>

13:33.471 --> 13:38.231
<i>She just happens to be the only one
 who can help me showcase my best.</i>

13:38.231 --> 13:41.211
Thank you all for your patience.

13:41.211 --> 13:44.741
We will now announce this year's
 winner based on the votes.

13:43.201 --> 13:45.691
This doesn't concern us, so let's bail.

13:45.691 --> 13:46.741
You said it.

13:47.151 --> 13:49.931
We will begin by announcing our queen.

13:49.931 --> 13:51.531
Do you mind waiting here for a sec?

13:53.991 --> 13:55.501
Here you go.

13:56.621 --> 13:57.501
What is this?

13:58.461 --> 14:00.851
Tomorrow's your birthday, right?

14:00.851 --> 14:03.501
I'm a day early, but it's 
your birthday present.

14:04.491 --> 14:07.111
It somehow slipped by last year,

14:07.111 --> 14:09.301
so I swore I'd get it in this year.

14:09.881 --> 14:12.511
I wanted to be the first
 to wish you happy birthday.

14:19.061 --> 14:20.391
Oh, snow!

14:20.391 --> 14:21.521
Awesome!

14:21.521 --> 14:23.531
It's snowing!

14:23.531 --> 14:25.191
You're like a little kid.

14:25.191 --> 14:28.241
But this is my first time seeing snow.

14:28.241 --> 14:29.171
Real snow!

14:29.171 --> 14:30.221
Really?

14:30.221 --> 14:31.281
Really.

14:31.701 --> 14:32.911
It's so cold!

14:33.671 --> 14:35.741
Oh, it melted.

14:35.741 --> 14:36.791
Ah!

14:39.791 --> 14:41.041
You're going to catch a cold.

14:45.251 --> 14:47.351
Happy birthday, Sano.

14:48.551 --> 14:49.541
Thank you.

14:59.181 --> 15:00.641
Looks like it's going to stick.

15:00.641 --> 15:02.061
Want me to warm you up?

15:02.061 --> 15:03.271
Senpai!

15:03.271 --> 15:04.261
Akiha!

15:04.261 --> 15:05.431
What are you doing here?

15:05.431 --> 15:06.321
Let go!

15:07.381 --> 15:10.771
Christmas is just around the corner.
 Maybe I should stay over at your place?

15:10.771 --> 15:12.171
Absolutely not.

15:16.081 --> 15:19.371
Oh, wow, this is so nice.

15:19.371 --> 15:22.961
Hey, wasn't that my present?

15:24.191 --> 15:26.641
But it feels so good.

15:27.911 --> 15:31.131
I'm a day early, but it's 
your birthday present.

15:34.761 --> 15:37.011
<i>An ultrasonic massager!</i>

15:37.461 --> 15:38.931
<i>This is so unsexy.</i>

15:38.931 --> 15:40.671
It was a bargain!

15:40.671 --> 15:42.661
I got it pretty cheap!

15:43.271 --> 15:47.091
Don't even worry about the price.

15:48.021 --> 15:49.531
I told you, I'm happy you got it.

15:52.321 --> 15:53.441
Thank you.

15:56.781 --> 15:58.051
<i>Calm down.</i>

15:58.051 --> 15:59.951
<i>I need to calm down.</i>

16:01.041 --> 16:02.411
Julia

16:02.871 --> 16:04.191
It's Julia.

16:04.191 --> 16:05.171
Mizuki!

16:05.171 --> 16:07.541
Wanna have some taiyaki with me?

16:07.541 --> 16:10.051
Clingy

16:07.541 --> 16:08.391
Hey.

16:08.391 --> 16:10.051
Yay, I want some!

16:13.431 --> 16:17.691
You know, the old me would've seen 
this and just completely lost it,

16:17.691 --> 16:19.931
but the new me is different.

16:19.931 --> 16:22.181
I'm manning up to the max!

16:22.181 --> 16:26.691
So as the super manly 
Nakatsu-kun Revolution Type E,

16:26.691 --> 16:28.841
Mizuki, your heart will beat for m—

16:28.841 --> 16:30.321
How's it going, Julia?

16:31.321 --> 16:32.481
<i>Hi, Mizuki!</i>

16:32.481 --> 16:33.511
<i>I'm doing great.</i>

16:33.511 --> 16:37.701
<i>Listen, I was wondering how the 
dance turned out for you.</i>

16:39.461 --> 16:40.761
Well, actually...

16:40.761 --> 16:43.831
Hey. Been a while, American woman.

16:44.261 --> 16:47.961
<i>I see you're as annoying as ever, 
you dumb ape.</i>

16:47.961 --> 16:49.761
How dare you?!

16:49.761 --> 16:50.941
Hey, guys.

16:51.751 --> 16:54.341
I got this coupon from my grandma.

16:54.341 --> 16:55.471
Want to go skating?

16:55.471 --> 16:56.831
Yeah!

16:57.471 --> 16:59.101
<i>That sounds like...</i>

16:59.101 --> 17:00.601
Hi, Julia.

17:01.311 --> 17:03.601
It's been months since you left,

17:03.601 --> 17:05.381
and you have no idea how lonely I've—

17:05.381 --> 17:06.911
She hung up.

17:12.731 --> 17:17.431
Don't just stand there! 
Come over here, Nakatsu!

17:17.431 --> 17:18.621
Y-Yeah...

17:18.621 --> 17:21.621
Hey, that guy can't skate!

17:21.621 --> 17:22.661
Ha ha!

17:22.661 --> 17:23.621
You idiots!

17:23.621 --> 17:25.211
When it comes to winter sports,

17:25.211 --> 17:29.221
we Kansai folks ski or snowboard
 in the Lake Biwa valley.

17:29.221 --> 17:31.751
We can go skating blindfolded!

17:31.751 --> 17:35.261
Being able to skate in that 
position is a talent all its own.

17:37.101 --> 17:39.261
Ashiya looks like he's having fun.

17:39.261 --> 17:41.391
Like a fish in the water.

17:43.271 --> 17:46.891
There's someone else taking 
to this like a fish to water.

17:46.891 --> 17:49.901
I knew I recognized you as 
one of those PuPa models!

17:49.901 --> 17:52.321
You look so good in real life!

17:52.321 --> 17:56.091
I can't believe it. 
Is that coat from the shoot?

17:56.091 --> 17:59.161
He's resorting to cheap tricks, I see.

18:01.031 --> 18:02.781
Senpai!

18:03.391 --> 18:07.191
You said you'd skate with me.

18:08.561 --> 18:10.041
You're such a bad boy.

18:10.521 --> 18:12.531
W-We can't compete!

18:13.041 --> 18:15.151
Let's go, Senpai.

18:15.881 --> 18:17.551
So this is my life now...

18:17.551 --> 18:19.841
Nakao's got a new strategy.

18:19.841 --> 18:21.011
Smart play.

18:21.011 --> 18:24.561
Efficient and he didn't hafta
sacrifice anything himself...

18:24.931 --> 18:27.061
Hey, hey, what are you guys talking about?

18:27.061 --> 18:31.061
Oh, yeah, Nakao-kun walks a hard road.

18:31.061 --> 18:35.731
After all, he fell for the guy 
who got crowned king.

18:35.731 --> 18:37.711
That's right.

18:37.711 --> 18:40.091
I thought Hibari-sama was overwhelming.

18:40.091 --> 18:41.241
Absolutely!

18:41.511 --> 18:44.301
It's no wonder she was crowned queen!

18:44.781 --> 18:47.041
That's not what I meant.

18:47.041 --> 18:48.381
Hibari-sama!

18:48.451 --> 18:49.601
Hibari-sama!

18:49.661 --> 18:51.711
Hibari-sama!

18:51.711 --> 18:52.771
You know,

18:52.771 --> 18:56.611
I'm convinced the voting was 
rigged so only St. Blossom could win.

18:56.611 --> 18:57.491
Yeah.

18:58.041 --> 19:00.971
I thought Ashiya was cuter.

19:00.971 --> 19:02.221
A rival!

19:03.181 --> 19:05.011
What are you talking about, Kayashima?

19:05.011 --> 19:06.971
I mean, look at yourselves.

19:07.381 --> 19:10.601
You two won the special 
award for best couple.

19:10.601 --> 19:13.641
<i>Oh, yeah!</i>

19:13.641 --> 19:16.361
<i>I never thought Sano and I would 
win an award together!</i>

19:16.741 --> 19:20.211
But it's not like that's
 super official or anything.

19:20.211 --> 19:23.991
The real best couple was 
Tennoji and Kanna-chan.

19:25.411 --> 19:27.661
<i>I'm such a loser!</i>

19:27.661 --> 19:29.711
<i>If only I hadn't passed out back then!</i>

19:29.711 --> 19:32.601
<i>The best couple would've
 been me and Mizuki!</i>

19:32.601 --> 19:33.251
Dumdum.

19:34.611 --> 19:35.591
Kyomi?

19:36.621 --> 19:38.401
What are you doing here?

19:38.401 --> 19:41.041
Hey! I told you to not run off!

19:42.151 --> 19:43.511
Kagurazaka?

19:43.801 --> 19:46.321
Look at you, being a good big brother.

19:46.321 --> 19:48.261
The hell are you talking about?

19:48.261 --> 19:49.601
Onii-chan!

19:49.601 --> 19:50.891
Tamami-chan!

19:52.021 --> 19:53.961
Haven't seen you in forever!

19:52.021 --> 19:53.961
From Tokyo High School?

19:53.961 --> 19:54.651
Yeah.

19:58.151 --> 20:01.281
What a coincidence, Mizuki-kun.

20:01.281 --> 20:03.891
Izumi-sama, you're going
 for the next meet, right?

20:03.891 --> 20:05.031
I'll be cheering for you!

20:05.031 --> 20:06.411
Later!

20:07.801 --> 20:11.161
Sano, you better not get some lame score.

20:11.621 --> 20:13.161
Of course not.

20:16.761 --> 20:17.921
Let's go.

20:19.461 --> 20:20.411
Kyomi.

20:21.171 --> 20:22.801
High five!

20:25.461 --> 20:26.431
Wait.

20:26.431 --> 20:28.441
Those are Rio-chan's parents!

20:28.441 --> 20:29.181
Oh my!

20:29.651 --> 20:31.281
Are you two on a date?

20:31.281 --> 20:32.681
That's right!

20:32.681 --> 20:34.511
The coupon expires today.

20:34.511 --> 20:37.871
Wait, those two are 
Doctor Umeda's parents?

20:37.871 --> 20:40.631
They're in their fifties. Just sayin'.

20:40.631 --> 20:43.741
Nanba-senpai, wait for me!

20:43.741 --> 20:44.451
Wait a second.

20:44.451 --> 20:47.781
That long-haired cutie is Minami-chan!

20:47.781 --> 20:52.081
Oh, fancy running into you,
 Granma and Granpa...

20:52.081 --> 20:54.211
Granma? Granpa?

20:54.811 --> 20:57.081
Granma? Granpa?

20:57.571 --> 20:59.091
He's their grandson?!

20:59.091 --> 21:01.211
Then that means Io is...

21:00.211 --> 21:03.341
Mother & Son

21:01.211 --> 21:02.091
Umeda is...

21:01.211 --> 21:03.341
Uncle & Nephew

21:02.091 --> 21:03.551
Rio-chan is...

21:02.091 --> 21:03.341
Aunt & Nephew

21:03.551 --> 21:04.411
What's up?

21:04.411 --> 21:05.341
What's going on?

21:05.341 --> 21:08.511
What's going on is that 
Rio-chan is Nanba's aunt.

21:08.511 --> 21:09.981
<i>Rio-chan, I'm so sorry!</i>

21:08.511 --> 21:10.541
What? Rio-chan is his aunt?!

21:09.981 --> 21:11.271
<i>It got out!</i>

21:10.541 --> 21:12.351
Aunt? His <i>aunt</i>?!

21:12.351 --> 21:14.561
Oh, you, Minami-chan!

21:14.561 --> 21:18.151
I've told you so many times to just 
call us Mama Seira and Papa Azuma!

21:18.151 --> 21:19.361
Seira.

21:20.311 --> 21:21.361
Come to me.

21:22.741 --> 21:24.061
<i>Squee!</i>

21:24.061 --> 21:26.021
Azuma-chan!

21:26.021 --> 21:28.341
Th-Thanks for that...

21:28.341 --> 21:29.861
By the way,

21:29.861 --> 21:33.241
they won the best couple award 
at the joint ball in their day.

21:36.141 --> 21:41.251
<i>Whoever gets voted best couple
supposedly lives happily ever after.</i>

21:41.751 --> 21:46.481
<i>Seeing them together, I can't just
 write it off as superstition.</i>

21:48.861 --> 21:50.641
That was close.

21:51.181 --> 21:52.511
Thank you.

21:52.511 --> 21:53.911
Be careful.

21:53.911 --> 21:56.021
It's really slippery at
the edge of the rink.

21:56.541 --> 21:58.601
Let's go skate.

22:00.601 --> 22:02.521
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

22:06.071 --> 22:09.281
<i>Maybe a little of the
 superstition will rub off.</i>

22:09.551 --> 22:12.281
<i>We did win best couple, after all.</i>

22:20.341 --> 22:22.541
<i>I'm so happy right now.</i>

22:22.791 --> 22:27.311
<i>May Sano and I always be together!</i>
